Error [E1293]: Lint `unused_local_binding` (`L0101`) is denied by policy: Local binding `unused_binding` is never read.
  --> tests/ui/lint_policy_liveness/run.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     unused_binding :: 1
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A binding that no later expression reads adds dead code and may hide a computed result that should have been used. This team's `policy.lints.deny` in `package.jet` turns this warning into a build failure (D-LINTPOLICY1 — the override law); it stays a warning everywhere `package.jet` doesn't opt in. The listed lint name matches.
 Fix: Use the underlying lint fix (Remove the binding when its initializer is side-effect free, or rename `unused_binding` to `_unused_binding` when the value must be computed.), or remove `unused_local_binding` from `policy.lints.deny` if this team no longer wants the wall.
